
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ALIES Al-Amin 2027: Olimpiade SD/MI Tingkat Nasional</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Ikuti ALIES Al-Amin 2027! Ajang olimpiade pelajar SD/MI bergengsi dari Al Amin Mojokerto. Asah potensi akademis dan raih prestasimu. Daftar sekarang!">
    
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <!-- FontAwesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">

    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    
    <!-- Tailwind Configuration -->
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        primarydark: '#7b542f',
                        primarymed: '#b6771d',
                        accentgold: '#ff9d00',
                        softcream: '#ffcf71',
                        backgroundlight: '#fdfbf7',
                        charcoalgrey: '#2d2d2d'
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        heading: ['"Plus Jakarta Sans"', 'sans-serif'],
                        body: ['Inter', 'sans-serif']
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <!-- Libraries CDN (React, ReactDOM, Babel, Lenis) -->
    <script crossorigin src="https://unpkg.com/react@18/umd/react.development.js"></script>
    <script crossorigin src="https://unpkg.com/react-dom@18/umd/react-dom.development.js"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@babel/standalone/babel.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/@studio-freight/lenis@1.0.39/dist/lenis.min.js"></script>

    <!-- Custom CSS (Designer Enhancements) -->
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #fdfbf7;
            color: #2d2d2d;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            overscroll-behavior: none; 
        }

        /* Hide default cursor on desktop */
        @media (pointer: fine) {
            body, a, button, input, textarea {
                cursor: none !important;
            }
        }

        /* Custom Cursor styling */
        #custom-cursor {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0;
            width: 12px; height: 12px;
            background-color: #ff9d00;
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 99999;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            transition: width 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1), 
                        height 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1),
                        background-color 0.3s ease;
            mix-blend-mode: difference;
        }

        #custom-cursor.hovered {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background-color: #ffcf71;
            mix-blend-mode: normal;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Preloader */
        #preloader {
            position: fixed;
            inset: 0;
            background-color: #fdfbf7;
            z-index: 100000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .loader-text {
            clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 0% 100%);
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6, .font-heading {
            font-family: '"Plus Jakarta Sans"', sans-serif;
        }

        .navbar-transparent {
            background: transparent;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 84, 47, 0.05);
        }

        .navbar-scrolled {
            background: rgba(253, 251, 247, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 84, 47, 0.1);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(123, 84, 47, 0.05);
        }

        .hero-bg {
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(255, 207, 113, 0.3) 0%, transparent 60%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 80%, rgba(123, 84, 47, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        #fdfbf7;
        }

        .transition-smooth {
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-15px) rotate(1deg); }
            100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
        }
        .animate-float {
            animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .gsap-init {
            visibility: hidden;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="antialiased selection:bg-accentgold selection:text-white">

    <!-- PRELOADER -->
    <div id="preloader">
        <div class="loader-text overflow-hidden">
            <h1 id="loader-heading" class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold text-primarydark tracking-tighter">ALIES 2027</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="w-48 h-1 bg-primarymed/20 mt-6 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
            <div id="loader-bar" class="h-full bg-accentgold w-0 rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CUSTOM CURSOR -->
    <div id="custom-cursor" class="hidden lg:block"></div>

    <!-- 1. NAVBAR -->
    <header id="navbar" class="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full z-50 navbar-transparent transition-smooth">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center h-20">
                <a href="#home" class="flex items-center gap-2 magnetic-element" data-magnetic-strength="20">
                    <span class="font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold text-primarydark tracking-tight">ALIES 2027</span>
                </a>

                <nav class="hidden lg:flex items-center space-x-8">
                    <a href="#home" class="text-sm font-medium text-charcoalgrey hover:text-accentgold transition-colors hover-trigger">Home</a>
                    <a href="#about" class="text-sm font-medium text-charcoalgrey hover:text-accentgold transition-colors hover-trigger">About</a>
                    <a href="#categories" class="text-sm font-medium text-charcoalgrey hover:text-accentgold transition-colors hover-trigger">Cabang Lomba</a>
                    <a href="#benefits" class="text-sm font-medium text-charcoalgrey hover:text-accentgold transition-colors hover-trigger">Hadiah</a>
                    <a href="#gallery" class="text-sm font-medium text-charcoalgrey hover:text-accentgold transition-colors hover-trigger">Dokumentasi</a>
                    <a href="#faq" class="text-sm font-medium text-charcoalgrey hover:text-accentgold transition-colors hover-trigger">FAQ</a>
                </nav>

                <div class="hidden lg:flex items-center magnetic-element" data-magnetic-strength="40">
                    <a href="#contact" class="px-6 py-3 bg-primarydark text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-primarymed transition-smooth hover-trigger">
                        Daftar Sekarang
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="lg:hidden flex items-center">
                    <button id="mobile-menu-btn" aria-label="Toggle Menu" class="text-primarydark p-2 hover-trigger">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bars text-2xl"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile Menu -->
        <div id="mobile-menu" class="lg:hidden hidden bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-xl border-b border-gray-100 shadow-2xl absolute w-full transition-smooth">
            <div class="px-6 py-5 space-y-3">
                <a href="#home" class="mobile-link block text-base font-medium text-charcoalgrey">Home</a>
                <a href="#about" class="mobile-link block text-base font-medium text-charcoalgrey">About</a>
                <a href="#categories" class="mobile-link block text-base font-medium text-charcoalgrey">Cabang Lomba</a>
                <a href="#benefits" class="mobile-link block text-base font-medium text-charcoalgrey">Hadiah</a>
                <a href="#faq" class="mobile-link block text-base font-medium text-charcoalgrey">FAQ</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="mobile-link block text-center w-full py-3 mt-4 bg-primarydark text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-md">
                    Daftar Sekarang
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- 3. HERO SECTION -->
        <section id="home" class="hero-bg pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-32 relative overflow-hidden flex items-center min-h-screen">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none bg-[radial-gradient(#b6771d_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px] hero-parallax" data-speed="0.2"></div>

            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 w-full">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
                    
                    <div class="lg:col-span-7 text-left hero-parallax" data-speed="0.1">
                        <div class="hero-elem gsap-init inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-1 px-3.5 rounded-full bg-softcream/40 text-primarydark text-xs font-bold tracking-wide uppercase mb-6 border border-primarymed/20">
                            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-accentgold animate-pulse"></span>
                            ALIES 2027 • NATIONAL STUDENT OLYMPIAD
                        </div>
                        
                        <h1 class="hero-elem gsap-init font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold text-primarydark leading-tight tracking-tighter mb-6 relative">
                            CROWN YOUR MIND, <br>
                            <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-primarymed to-accentgold relative inline-block">
                                RISE AS A CHAMPION
                                <svg class="absolute w-full h-3 -bottom-1 left-0 text-softcream/60 -z-10" viewBox="0 0 100 10" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 5 Q 50 10 100 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" fill="transparent"/></svg>
                            </span>
                        </h1>
                        
                        <p class="hero-elem gsap-init text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-primarymed mb-4">
                            "Merdeka Berprestasi, Berkarya Menginspirasi"
                        </p>
                        <p class="hero-elem gsap-init text-base text-charcoalgrey/80 max-w-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
                            ALIES (Al-Amin Intelligence of Elementary School) merupakan ajang olimpiade pelajar tingkat SD/MI sederajat yang diselenggarakan oleh OSIS MTs–MA Pesantren Al-Amin Mojokerto.
                        </p>
                        
                        <div class="hero-elem gsap-init flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4">
                            <div class="magnetic-element" data-magnetic-strength="30">
                                <a href="#contact" class="px-8 py-4 bg-primarydark text-white font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-xl hover:bg-primarymed transition-smooth text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover-trigger">
                                    Daftar Sekarang <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right text-sm"></i>
                                </a>
                            </div>
                            <div class="magnetic-element" data-magnetic-strength="20">
                                <a href="#categories" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-sm text-primarydark border border-primarymed/30 font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:bg-softcream/30 transition-smooth text-center hover-trigger">
                                    Lihat Cabang Lomba
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative hero-visual gsap-init hero-parallax" data-speed="-0.1">
                        <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-md lg:max-w-none">
                            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-8 relative overflow-hidden animate-float">
                                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6">
                                    <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-accentgold/20 text-primarydark text-xs font-bold rounded-full">Open Registration</span>
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-award text-2xl text-primarymed"></i>
                                </div>

                                <div class="w-full h-56 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primarydark/5 to-softcream/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center p-6 relative mb-6 group cursor-none hover-trigger">
                                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-6xl text-primarydark mb-4 transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"></i>
                                    <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-primarydark text-lg">Musha the Knight</h3>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-charcoalgrey/70 mt-1">Official Mascot of ALIES 2027</p>
                                </div>

                                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 border-t border-primarymed/10 text-center">
                                    <div>
                                        <div class="font-heading font-extrabold text-primarydark text-2xl">4+</div>
                                        <div class="text-xs text-charcoalgrey/60 mt-1">Cabang Lomba</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="border-x border-primarymed/10">
                                        <div class="font-heading font-extrabold text-primarydark text-2xl">2027</div>
                                        <div class="text-xs text-charcoalgrey/60 mt-1">Tahun Event</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div>
                                        <div class="font-heading font-extrabold text-primarydark text-2xl">SD/MI</div>
                                        <div class="text-xs text-charcoalgrey/60 mt-1">Peserta</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="absolute -bottom-10 -left-10 w-48 h-48 bg-softcream/40 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. ABOUT ALIES -->
        <section id="about" class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
                    
                    <div class="lg:col-span-7 about-content gsap-init">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primarydark uppercase tracking-widest bg-softcream/50 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full">Tentang ALIES</span>
                        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-primarydark mt-6 mb-8 tracking-tight">
                            Membangun Generasi Cerdas & Berkarakter
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-lg text-charcoalgrey/80 leading-relaxed mb-6 font-light">
                            <strong>ALIES (Al-Amin Intelligence of Elementary School)</strong> adalah kompetisi akademik bergengsi yang dirancang khusus untuk menguji kemampuan dan potensi terbaik pelajar tingkat sekolah dasar sederajat. 
                        </p>
                        <p class="text-base text-charcoalgrey/70 leading-relaxed mb-10">
                            Diselenggarakan secara konsisten oleh OSIS MTs–MA Pesantren Al-Amin Mojokerto, acara ini tidak hanya sekadar ajang perlombaan akademik, tetapi juga sarana pembentukan karakter luhur, sportivitas, dan daya saing global.
                        </p>

                        <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm font-semibold text-primarydark">
                            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 hover-trigger magnetic-element" data-magnetic-strength="10">
                                <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-primarydark ring-4 ring-primarydark/20"></span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-charcoalgrey/60">2007/2008</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex-1 h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-primarydark/20 to-primarymed/20"></div>
                            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 hover-trigger magnetic-element" data-magnetic-strength="10">
                                <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-primarymed ring-4 ring-primarymed/20"></span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-charcoalgrey/60">Agenda Tahunan</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex-1 h-[2px] bg-gradient-to-r from-primarymed/20 to-accentgold/20"></div>
                            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 hover-trigger magnetic-element" data-magnetic-strength="10">
                                <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-accentgold ring-4 ring-accentgold/20 animate-pulse"></span>
                                <span class="text-xs text-charcoalgrey/60">ALIES 2027</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lg:col-span-5 about-card gsap-init relative">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primarymed/10 transform rotate-3 rounded-[32px] scale-105 -z-10 transition-transform duration-500"></div>
                        <div class="rounded-[32px] border border-white/60 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-xl p-10 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden group hover-trigger">
                            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primarydark to-primarymed text-white flex items-center justify-center mb-8 shadow-lg transform group-hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-500">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-2xl"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primarydark mb-2">Filosofi Kami</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-charcoalgrey/60 mb-6">Al-Amin Intelligence of Elementary School</p>
                            <p class="text-base text-charcoalgrey/80 leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 italic">
                                "Mencetak generasi yang cerdas secara intelektual, tangguh secara mental, serta memiliki semangat kebangsaan yang tinggi dalam balutan nilai Islami."
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 5. NILAI DAN TUJUAN -->
        <section class="py-24 bg-backgroundlight border-y border-primarymed/5 relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-gradient-to-l from-softcream/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
                <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-20 values-header gsap-init">
                    <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-primarydark mb-4">
                        Why Join ALIES?
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-lg text-charcoalgrey/60">Empat pilar utama yang mendasari setiap pelaksanaan kompetisi.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                    <div class="value-card gsap-init group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 border border-transparent hover:border-primarymed/20 hover-trigger cursor-none">
                        <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-transparent text-stroke mb-6" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1px #b6771d; opacity: 0.3;">01</div>
                        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primarydark mb-3">Kompetitif</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-charcoalgrey/70 leading-relaxed">Mengasah kemampuan akademik dan daya saing peserta secara optimal.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="value-card gsap-init group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 border border-transparent hover:border-primarymed/20 hover-trigger cursor-none">
                        <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-transparent text-stroke mb-6" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1px #b6771d; opacity: 0.3;">02</div>
                        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primarydark mb-3">Sportif</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-charcoalgrey/70 leading-relaxed">Membangun karakter kompetitif yang sehat, jujur, dan menjunjung sportivitas.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="value-card gsap-init group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 border border-transparent hover:border-primarymed/20 hover-trigger cursor-none">
                        <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-transparent text-stroke mb-6" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1px #b6771d; opacity: 0.3;">03</div>
                        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primarydark mb-3">Inspiratif</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-charcoalgrey/70 leading-relaxed">Mendorong generasi muda untuk berkarya dan menginspirasi lingkungan sekitar.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="value-card gsap-init group bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-500 border border-transparent hover:border-primarymed/20 hover-trigger cursor-none">
                        <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-transparent text-stroke mb-6" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1px #b6771d; opacity: 0.3;">04</div>
                        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-primarydark mb-3">Berprestasi</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-charcoalgrey/70 leading-relaxed">Memberikan ruang bagi siswa untuk menunjukkan potensi terbaiknya secara nasional.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. CABANG LOMBA -->
        <section id="categories" class="py-32 bg-white">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-16 cat-header gsap-init gap-6">
                    <div class="max-w-2xl">
                        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-primarydark mb-4">
                            Cabang Lomba
                        </h2>
                        <p class="text-lg text-charcoalgrey/60">Pilih bidang keahlian dan daftarkan dirimu segera.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="magnetic-element" data-magnetic-strength="20">
                        <a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-backgroundlight border border-primarymed/20 text-primarydark font-bold hover:bg-primarymed hover:text-white transition-smooth hover-trigger">
                            Unduh Silabus <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                    <div class="cat-card gsap-init bg-backgroundlight rounded-[32px] p-8 border border-primarymed/10 hover:border-primarymed/30 transition-smooth group cursor-none hover-trigger relative overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-primarymed/5 rounded-bl-full transform translate-x-10 -translate-y-10 group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-700"></div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-primarydark group-hover:bg-primarydark group-hover:text-white transition-smooth mb-8 relative z-10">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-flask text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primarymed uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">IPA</span>
                        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primarydark mb-4">Science</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm text-charcoalgrey/60 mb-8">Uji pemahaman dan analisis fenomena sains alam dengan kritis.</p>
                        <a href="#contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primarydark font-bold group-hover:text-primarymed transition-colors relative z-10">
                            Detail <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"></i>
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cat-card gsap-init bg-backgroundlight rounded-[32px] p-8 border border-primarymed/10 hover:border-primarymed/30 transition-smooth group cursor-none hover-trigger relative overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-accentgold/5 rounded-bl-full transform translate-x-10 -translate-y-10 group-hover:scale-150 transition-transform duration-700"></div>
                        <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm flex items-center justify-center text-primarydark group-hover:bg-primarydark group-hover:text-white transition-smooth mb-8 relative z-10">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-calculator text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-primarymed uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Matematika</span>
                        <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primarydark mb-4">Math</h3>
